    "name": "Turn Based Boxing: Tactics",
    "steam_appid": 2990450,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a violent world of underground boxing. In this turn-based  simulation (with free-will / auto-battle), you'll recruit, train, and manage a roster of boxing champions.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/2ba6ab55e784772dd0cf832fadbac6cc.poster.avif?t=1751041989\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/2ba6ab55e784772dd0cf832fadbac6cc.mp4?t=1751041989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Your Gym:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a diverse team of boxers with unique skills and styles. Each boxer contributes to earning cash for the gym. Use cash to train your boxers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruit or Create Boxers:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour the globe for the most talented fighters to join your gym. From seasoned veterans to up-and-coming prospects, every boxer has unique strengths, weaknesses, and personalities. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/3cd5a09d0ee9f89180743b67a529831c.poster.avif?t=1751041989\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/3cd5a09d0ee9f89180743b67a529831c.webm?t=1751041989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/3cd5a09d0ee9f89180743b67a529831c.mp4?t=1751041989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dozens of Perks / Endless Boxer Builds:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perks are special abilities or bonuses that enhance a boxer's performance in different aspects of the game. These can range from increased stamina and power to improved defensive maneuvers or tactical advantages in the ring. As the manager, you'll need to carefully choose which perks to invest in, ensuring they synergize with each boxer's strengths, weaknesses, fighting style, and the gyms overall goals. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/84c854f2d34b45f983cf7b19507a9045.poster.avif?t=1751041989\" width=800 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/84c854f2d34b45f983cf7b19507a9045.webm?t=1751041989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/84c854f2d34b45f983cf7b19507a9045.mp4?t=1751041989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Increasing Stats by Training:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to choosing perks, you can also allocate cash to increase your boxers' base stats. Each stat contributes to a boxer's overall performance in the ring and can be improved through targeted training and development programs. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/87efbf8328304b396986de1061a2c3cd.avif?t=1751041989\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perma-Death Mechanics:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a boxer sustains severe injuries during matches, there's a chance they could suffer permanent consequences, including death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/043401ab66c44fb129f501e9a7a4f0b8.avif?t=1751041989\" data-has-big width=800 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete Quests and Unlock Strategies:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet quest criteria to unlock strategies that any boxer in your gym can utilize. Strategies can be changed before each round of fighting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/b8de00259f2e3c0c16e382614e3a6cde.avif?t=1751041989\" data-has-big width=800 height=292 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Climb the Ranking and become a Boxing Legend:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With perseverance, strategy, and a little bit of luck, you'll lead your gym to greatness and cement your legacy as one of the greatest boxing managers of all time. Will you build a dynasty that stands the test of time, or will your dreams of glory die in pool of blood?   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/d782d65be2a28c3a430d33d1719666eb.avif?t=1751041989\" data-has-big width=800 height=268 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight in Epic Boxing Battles:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Turn Based Boxing&quot; offers a deep and immersive experience for fans of both boxing and management simulations. Are you ready to step into the ring and become a champion?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a violent world of underground boxing. In this turn-based  simulation (with free-will / auto-battle), you'll recruit, train, and manage a roster of boxing champions.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/2ba6ab55e784772dd0cf832fadbac6cc.poster.avif?t=1751041989\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/2ba6ab55e784772dd0cf832fadbac6cc.mp4?t=1751041989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Your Gym:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a diverse team of boxers with unique skills and styles. Each boxer contributes to earning cash for the gym. Use cash to train your boxers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruit or Create Boxers:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour the globe for the most talented fighters to join your gym. From seasoned veterans to up-and-coming prospects, every boxer has unique strengths, weaknesses, and personalities. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/3cd5a09d0ee9f89180743b67a529831c.poster.avif?t=1751041989\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/3cd5a09d0ee9f89180743b67a529831c.webm?t=1751041989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/3cd5a09d0ee9f89180743b67a529831c.mp4?t=1751041989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dozens of Perks / Endless Boxer Builds:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perks are special abilities or bonuses that enhance a boxer's performance in different aspects of the game. These can range from increased stamina and power to improved defensive maneuvers or tactical advantages in the ring. As the manager, you'll need to carefully choose which perks to invest in, ensuring they synergize with each boxer's strengths, weaknesses, fighting style, and the gyms overall goals. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/84c854f2d34b45f983cf7b19507a9045.poster.avif?t=1751041989\" width=800 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/84c854f2d34b45f983cf7b19507a9045.webm?t=1751041989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/84c854f2d34b45f983cf7b19507a9045.mp4?t=1751041989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Increasing Stats by Training:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to choosing perks, you can also allocate cash to increase your boxers' base stats. Each stat contributes to a boxer's overall performance in the ring and can be improved through targeted training and development programs. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/87efbf8328304b396986de1061a2c3cd.avif?t=1751041989\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perma-Death Mechanics:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a boxer sustains severe injuries during matches, there's a chance they could suffer permanent consequences, including death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/043401ab66c44fb129f501e9a7a4f0b8.avif?t=1751041989\" data-has-big width=800 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete Quests and Unlock Strategies:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet quest criteria to unlock strategies that any boxer in your gym can utilize. Strategies can be changed before each round of fighting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/b8de00259f2e3c0c16e382614e3a6cde.avif?t=1751041989\" data-has-big width=800 height=292 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Climb the Ranking and become a Boxing Legend:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With perseverance, strategy, and a little bit of luck, you'll lead your gym to greatness and cement your legacy as one of the greatest boxing managers of all time. Will you build a dynasty that stands the test of time, or will your dreams of glory die in pool of blood?   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/d782d65be2a28c3a430d33d1719666eb.avif?t=1751041989\" data-has-big width=800 height=268 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight in Epic Boxing Battles:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Turn Based Boxing&quot; offers a deep and immersive experience for fans of both boxing and management simulations. Are you ready to step into the ring and become a champion?</p>",
    "short_description": "The most savage boxing simulation. From your backyard to stadium fights, build and train champion fighters. Difficult fights are strategic puzzles. Unlock coaching strategies. Manage finances and injuries to avoid sending your fighters to an early grave.",
